                    Zone, 1966. Confidential; Exdis. Drafted by
                    Malcolm Toon (EUR/SOV), October 18, and cleared in S/S
                    and S, October 19. Although the source text
                    provides no time, this conversation apparently took place at the same informal
                    dinner referenced in <ref target="#d158-f1">footnote 1, Document 158</ref>.</p>
            </note>
